==Battleground==
*3 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Samurai Doggy]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Teacher A]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Samurai Doggy|Samurai Doggies]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Having all Anti-Unstarred Alien treasures are recommended as they make this stage a lot easier. [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]]/[[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] helps nullify the pushing power of the Samurai Doggies. All that's left are the ranged enemies all of which (except for Nyandam) are outranged by Bahamut Cat and Ururun Wolf. You can either choose to use Bahamut's first/evolved form to slowly but surely kill the Audience Bears and Teacher As, or you can bring his true form and rush them down. Seafarer basically shuts down any difficulty in this stage.

